<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak May jobless rate dips to 12.32 pct (12.96).</title>
<headline>Slovak May jobless rate dips to 12.32 pct (12.96).</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The total number of jobless in Slovakia in May was 320,530, or 12.32 percent of the workforce down from 12.96 in April, the National Labour Office said on Thursday.</p>
<p> SLOVAK UNEMPLOYMENT	MAY 1997   APRIL 1997  MAY 1996</p>
<p>  Total jobless	     320,530     337,180     306,802</p>
<p>  Percentage of workforce  12.32	 12.96	 11.9</p>
<p>-- Peter Javurek, Bratislava Newsroom, 421-7-521-8402</p>
